To prevent spam, I don't share my email address publicly.

Edit message.eml with your name, reply address, and message, then send it
through the local MTA:
  ]8;;sh:nano ~/contact/message.eml\nano ~/contact/message.eml]8;;\
  ]8;;sh:sendmail -t < ~/contact/message.eml\sendmail -t < ~/contact/message.eml]8;;\
